    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a role-playing game, players need to play the role of the heroine, live streaming in a private prison to sell computers to pay off debts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Live streaming - actively interact with the audience to accumulate popularity and get customers to buy computers faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Configuration - Write reasonable computer configuration according to customer's needs and budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Installation - Complete the installation of the main computer according to the configuration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Display - Display the assembled computer host with graceful posture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Living - drinking, eating, bathing, defecating and sleeping in prison to maintain vital signs.</p>",
